    "detailed_description": "Grappling Hookguns: Ride around the aerial ruins!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/cedc171ee002f3270b96e2e82c0738f8.poster.avif?t=1669433654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/cedc171ee002f3270b96e2e82c0738f8.webm?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/cedc171ee002f3270b96e2e82c0738f8.mp4?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>.<br><br>HookEscaper is a high-speed 3D action racing game where you use a &quot;grappling hook gun&quot; to reach the finish line.<br><br>Find your own shortcuts in over 50 (planned) stages and aim for the fastest times! Don't worry, the possibilities with the Grappling Hook Gun are endless!<br><br><br>Gimmicks<br>Make the most of gimmicks!<br>Hook onto flying boulders and fly with them!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/5c81f2c008a3f28d16113437ea396456.poster.avif?t=1669433654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/5c81f2c008a3f28d16113437ea396456.webm?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/5c81f2c008a3f28d16113437ea396456.mp4?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>.<br><br><br>Hook the sky as you navigate through falling rocks!!!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/e79c3462d987fd28f6f8d055925d87f3.poster.avif?t=1669433654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/e79c3462d987fd28f6f8d055925d87f3.webm?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/e79c3462d987fd28f6f8d055925d87f3.mp4?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>.<br><br><br>Smash any gimmicks that get in your way!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/HookEscaper_BreakEnemy.gif ?t=1669433654\" /></div>.<br><br><br>You have to make your own way!<br>Even the things that seem to be in your way could help you!",
    "about_the_game": "Grappling Hookguns: Ride around the aerial ruins!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/cedc171ee002f3270b96e2e82c0738f8.poster.avif?t=1669433654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/cedc171ee002f3270b96e2e82c0738f8.webm?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/cedc171ee002f3270b96e2e82c0738f8.mp4?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>.<br><br>HookEscaper is a high-speed 3D action racing game where you use a &quot;grappling hook gun&quot; to reach the finish line.<br><br>Find your own shortcuts in over 50 (planned) stages and aim for the fastest times! Don't worry, the possibilities with the Grappling Hook Gun are endless!<br><br><br>Gimmicks<br>Make the most of gimmicks!<br>Hook onto flying boulders and fly with them!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/5c81f2c008a3f28d16113437ea396456.poster.avif?t=1669433654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/5c81f2c008a3f28d16113437ea396456.webm?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/5c81f2c008a3f28d16113437ea396456.mp4?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>.<br><br><br>Hook the sky as you navigate through falling rocks!!!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/e79c3462d987fd28f6f8d055925d87f3.poster.avif?t=1669433654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/e79c3462d987fd28f6f8d055925d87f3.webm?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/e79c3462d987fd28f6f8d055925d87f3.mp4?t=1669433654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>.<br><br><br>Smash any gimmicks that get in your way!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188300/extras/HookEscaper_BreakEnemy.gif ?t=1669433654\" /></div>.<br><br><br>You have to make your own way!<br>Even the things that seem to be in your way could help you!",
